@* حوار تعيين الأدوار لمستخدم — المفتاح الإنجليزي للمنطق، التسمية العربية للعرض فقط *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResources> Loc

<MudDialog>
    <TitleContent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@Loc["AssignRoles"] - @User.Email</MudText>
    </TitleContent>
    <DialogContent>
        @if (_isLoading)
        {
            <MudProgressLinear Indeterminate="true" Class="my-2" />
        }
        else
        {
            @if (_error is not null)
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Class="mb-2">@_error</MudAlert>
            }
            @foreach (var role in _allRoles)
            {
                <MudCheckBox T="bool" Value="@_selected[role.Name]" ValueChanged="@((bool v) => _selected[role.Name] = v)" Label="@DisplayLabel(role.Name)" />
            }
        }
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        <MudButton OnClick="Cancel" Color="Color.Default">@Loc["Cancel"]</MudButton>
        <MudButton OnClick="SaveAsync" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary">@Loc["Save"]</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [CascadingParameter] private IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; } = default!;

    [Parameter] public IUserService UserService { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter] public IRoleService RoleService { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter] public UserDto User { get; set; } = default!;

    private bool _isLoading = true;
    private string? _error;
    private List<RoleDto> _allRoles = new();
    private Dictionary<string, bool> _selected = new();

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        try
        {
            _allRoles = await RoleService.GetRolesAsync();
            var current = await UserService.GetUserRolesAsync(User.Id);
            foreach (var role in _allRoles)
                _selected[role.Name] = current.Contains(role.Name);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = ex.Message; }
        finally { _isLoading = false; }
    }

    private void Cancel() => MudDialog.Cancel();

    private string DisplayLabel(string roleName)
    {
        var localized = Loc[roleName];
        return localized.ResourceNotFound ? roleName : localized.Value;
    }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        _error = null;
        try
        {
            var selected = _selected.Where(kv => kv.Value).Select(kv => kv.Key).ToList();
            await UserService.SetUserRolesAsync(User.Id, selected);
            MudDialog.Close(DialogResult.Ok(true));
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = ex.Message; }
    }
}
